From 4d2dc63a049e47ea641ff0342ad6a88c6ab1fc07 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Apr 2021 10:56:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Update default ports to be based off p2p port 10605 (#157)

Since Lotus is not a ledger fork, there is no reason to maintain the
same default ports. In fact, this makes it harder for individuals to run
nodes on the same server as whatever of flavor of bitcoind they prefer.
This we're going to move to a different port to support ease of use for
node operators.

New ports:
* mainnet
  * p2p - 10605
  * rpc - 10604
* testnet
  * p2p - 11605
  * rpc - 11604
* regtest
  * p2p - 12605
  * rpc - 12604
* ZMQ - 13604

Closes #153

Rebase provenance: this historical change was adapted onto the pinned
Bitcoin ABC base. Source diff is the recorded Lotus V1 replay commit below.

Historical-source-commit: 8eda7d8c59651bc9948aefe167498a02d810c786
Recorded-replay-commit: 002d74622443fe27f755787e53df33cbc8570162

